#. TRANSLATORS: Closing note explaining the fallback if the user denies the permission
#: kt
msgid ""
"If you deny this permission, you can still use the Android System File "
"Picker to open your books by turning off the custom file browser setting."
msgstr ""
"Ako odbijete ovu dozvolu, još uvek možete da koristite Android sistemski "
"birač datoteka kako biste otvorili vaše knjige tako što ćete onemogućiti "
"podešavanje prilagođenog istraživača datoteka."

#. TRANSLATORS: Explanation of why the app requests the notifications permission
#: kt
msgid ""
"Lets Paperback show playback controls in the notification shade while text-"
"to-speech is reading, so you can pause, resume, and skip without reopening "
"the app."
msgstr ""
"Dozvoljava da Paperback prikaže kontrole za reprodukciju u panelu "
"obaveštenja dok govorni sintetizator čita, kako biste mogli da pauzirate, "
"nastavite i premotavate bez ponovnog otvaranja aplikacije."

#. TRANSLATORS: Explanation of why the app requests the all files access permission
#: kt
msgid ""
"Powers the optional in-app file browser, so you can open documents from "
"anywhere on your device — including network drives — instantly, with full "
"screen-reader support. You can skip this and use the system file picker "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Pokreće opcioni istraživač datoteka u aplikaciji, kako biste odmah mogli da "
"otvorite dokumente bilo gde sa vašeg uređaja — uključujući mrežne diskove , "
"uz punu podršku za čitače ekrana. Možete ovo da preskočite i da umesto toga "
"koristite sistemski birač datoteka."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced by the screen reader when the in-app file browser opens
#: kt
msgid "File Manager"
msgstr "Upravljač datoteka"

#. TRANSLATORS: How far through the document the reader has got, shown under the read-aloud progress bar; {} is a whole-number percentage
#: kt
msgid "{}% through"
msgstr "{}% kroz"

#. TRANSLATORS: Footer explaining the "Swipe up moves forward" toggle above it
#: swift
msgid ""
"With VoiceOver, swipe up on the play button to move forward, or down to move "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Uz VoiceOver, prevucite gore na tasteru za reprodukciju da se krećete "
"napred, ili dole da se krećete nazad."

#. TRANSLATORS: Explanation shown under the "Swipe up moves forward" switch
#: kt
msgid ""
"With TalkBack, swipe up on the play button to move forward, or down to move "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Uz TalkBack, prevucite gore na tasteru za reprodukciju da se krećete napred, "
"ili dole da se krećete nazad."

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack description of the folder the file browser is showing; {} is its path
#: kt
msgid "Current path: {}"
msgstr "Trenutna putanja: {}"

#: kt
msgid "{}, {}, modified {}{}"
msgstr "{}, {}, izmenjeno {}{}"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack state of a slider; {} is the number it is set to
#: kt
msgid "{} percent"
msgstr "{} procenata"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack state of a heading line in the document; {} is its level number
#: kt
msgid "Heading {}"
msgstr "Naslov {}"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action label for a heading in the elements list, read as "double tap to go to heading"
#: kt
msgid "go to heading"
msgstr "premesti se na naslov"

#: swift kt
msgid "{}, Level {}"
msgstr "{}, nivo {}"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action label for a link in the elements list, read as "double tap to go to link"
#: kt
msgid "go to link"
msgstr "premesti se na link"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action label for a long press that opens the import and export menu
#: kt
msgid "show import and export options"
msgstr "prikaži opcije uvoza i izvoza"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action label for a document in the recent list, read as "double tap to open"
#: kt
msgid "open"
msgstr "otvori"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action label for a table of contents entry, read as "double tap to go to chapter"
#: kt
msgid "go to chapter"
msgstr "pređi na poglavlje"

#. TRANSLATORS: Sentence spoken aloud to preview the selected speech engine, voice, rate and pitch
#: kt
msgid "This is a sample of the selected speech engine."
msgstr "Ovo je primer izabranog sintetizatora govora."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when the Go To Page shortcut is used on a document with no page numbers
#: kt
msgid "This document does not contain pages."
msgstr "Ovaj dokument ne sadrži stranice."

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the "formula" reading/navigation unit
#: swift kt
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Formula"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when a Find query matches nothing anywhere in the document
#: kt swift
msgid "No matches."
msgstr "Nema podudaranja."

#. TRANSLATORS: Label for the picker choosing whether the app follows the system light/dark setting or is pinned to one of them
#: swift
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Izgled"

#. TRANSLATORS: Appearance option following the phone's own light/dark setting
#: swift
msgid "System"
msgstr "Sistem"

#. TRANSLATORS: Appearance option pinning the app to its light colours
#: swift
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Svetla"

#. TRANSLATORS: Appearance option pinning the app to its dark colours
#: swift
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Tamna"

#. TRANSLATORS: Toggle that renders document text in pure black on white, or white on black
#: kt swift
msgid "High Contrast Text"
msgstr "Tekst visokog kontrasta"

#. TRANSLATORS: Toggle that removes the reading bar's previous/next buttons from the screen reader's swipe order, since the play button's swipe up/down does the same thing
#: kt swift
msgid "Hide previous and next buttons"
msgstr "Sakrij dugmad za sledeće i prethodno"

#. TRANSLATORS: Body of the dialog confirming that the recent documents list should be emptied
#: kt swift
msgid "This empties the list. The documents themselves are not deleted."
msgstr "Ovo prazni listu. Sami dokumenti se ne brišu."

#. TRANSLATORS: Value of the paragraph pause setting; {} is a number of milliseconds
#: kt swift
msgid "{} ms"
msgstr "{} ms"

#. TRANSLATORS: Row label for the setting that adds silence between paragraphs when reading aloud
#: kt swift
msgid "Paragraph Pause"
msgstr "Pauza pasusa"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack value announced on the voice picker when the chosen engine offers nothing to choose between
#: kt
msgid "No other voices"
msgstr "Nema drugih glasova"

#. TRANSLATORS: Export option that shares the document's own file, exactly as it is, rather than converting it
#: swift
msgid "Original file"
msgstr "Originalna datoteka"

#. TRANSLATORS: Toast confirming the document's settings were exported to a .paperback file, or the failure message if not
#: kt
msgid "Settings exported"
msgstr "Podešavanja izvezena"

